msgstr "Přidán"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/linked.go:114
msgid ""
"The mail service does not describe this account; update it and try again"
msgstr ""
"Poštovní služba tento účet nepopisuje; aktualizujte ji a zkuste to znovu"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a provider such as "Microsoft 365" or "Google".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/linked.go:152
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This address belongs to a %s account. Add it under Settings → Online "
"Accounts, then come back here."
msgstr ""
"Tato adresa patří k účtu %s. Přidejte ho v Nastavení → Účty online a pak se "
"sem vraťte."

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/linked.go:177 ui/internal/window/sync.go:499
msgid "Could not open Online Accounts; open GNOME Settings yourself"
msgstr "Účty online se nepodařilo otevřít; otevřete Nastavení GNOME ručně"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/linked.go:193
msgid "This address is not signed in yet"
msgstr "Tato adresa ještě není přihlášená"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a provider such as "Google" or "Microsoft 365".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:74
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your browser will open so you can sign in to %s. Malachi Mail never sees "
"your password; it only receives permission to read and send your mail."
msgstr ""
"Otevře se prohlížeč, ve kterém se přihlásíte k účtu %s. Malachi Mail vaše "
"heslo nikdy neuvidí; dostane jen oprávnění číst a odesílat poštu."

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a provider such as "Google" or "Microsoft 365".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:76
#, c-format
msgid "_Sign In with %s"
msgstr "_Přihlásit se přes %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: progressive form for the RPC error text
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:140 ui/internal/window/sync.go:527
#: ui/internal/window/contacts_consent.go:32
msgid "Starting the sign-in"
msgstr "Zahájení přihlášení"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a provider such as "Google" or "Microsoft 365".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:289
#, c-format
msgid ""
"No OAuth client is configured for %s on this computer. Add a client ID to "
"the mail backend's configuration and try again."
msgstr ""
"Pro %s není na tomto počítači nastaven žádný klient OAuth. Přidejte ID "
"klienta do nastavení poštovního backendu a zkuste to znovu."

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:319
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/wizard.go:496
msgid "Enter the app password for this account"
msgstr "Zadejte heslo aplikace pro tento účet"

#. TRANSLATORS: title of the page the browser shows
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:342
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:604
msgid "Signed in"
msgstr "Přihlášeno"

#. TRANSLATORS: page the browser shows
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:344
msgid "You can close this tab and return to Malachi Mail."
msgstr "Tuto kartu můžete zavřít a vrátit se do Malachi Mail."

#. TRANSLATORS: title of the page the browser shows
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:346
msgid "Sign-in failed"
msgstr "Přihlášení selhalo"

#. TRANSLATORS: page the browser shows
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:348
msgid "Return to Malachi Mail and try again."
msgstr "Vraťte se do Malachi Mail a zkuste to znovu."

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:358
msgid "The sign-in was cancelled"
msgstr "Přihlášení bylo zrušeno"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a provider such as "Google" or "Microsoft 365".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:361
#, c-format
msgid "The sign-in with %s was refused"
msgstr "Přihlášení přes %s bylo odmítnuto"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:363
#: ui/internal/assistant/assistant.go:932
msgid "The sign-in took too long; try again"
msgstr "Přihlášení trvalo příliš dlouho, zkuste to znovu"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is an e-mail address.
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:366
#, c-format
msgid "The browser signed in to %s, not to this address"
msgstr "Prohlížeč se přihlásil k účtu %s, ne k této adrese"

#. TRANSLATORS: progressive form for the RPC error text
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/oauth.go:369 ui/internal/crm/text.go:438
#: ui/internal/crm/text.go:535
msgid "Signing in"
msgstr "Přihlašování"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/results.go:62
msgid "Not tested"
msgstr "Netestováno"

#. TRANSLATORS: %d is the connection latency in milliseconds.
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/results.go:66
#, c-format
msgid "Connected in %d ms"
msgstr "Připojeno za %d ms"

#. TRANSLATORS: banner on the identity page of the account assistant
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/results.go:86
msgid "No password is stored for this account. Enter it to continue."
msgstr "Pro tento účet není uložené heslo. Zadejte ho a pokračujte."

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/results.go:88 ui/internal/crm/text.go:556
#: ui/internal/widget/rpc.go:103
msgid "The server rejected the user name or password"
msgstr "Server odmítl uživatelské jméno nebo heslo"

#. TRANSLATORS: joins two servers ("host:port") in the sentence
#. "… accept exactly this certificate for %s and no other …".
#. TRANSLATORS: joins the last item of a list, e.g. "Monday and
#. Wednesday".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:83 ui/internal/calendar/recurrence.go:74
#, c-format
msgid "%s and %s"
msgstr "%s a %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: dialog heading, the pinned certificate of a server
#. has changed
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:101 ui/internal/aiaccount/dialog.go:358
msgid "Trust the New Certificate?"
msgstr "Důvěřovat novému certifikátu?"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is one server ("host:port") or two joined by
#. "%s and %s".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:104 ui/internal/aiaccount/dialog.go:361
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The certificate of %s has changed since you trusted it. If you did not renew "
"it yourself, someone may be intercepting the connection. Trust the new "
"certificate only if you know why it changed."
msgstr ""
"Certifikát serveru %s se od chvíle, kdy jste mu začali důvěřovat, změnil. "
"Pokud jste ho sami neobnovili, může někdo odposlouchávat spojení. Novému "
"certifikátu důvěřujte, jen pokud víte, proč se změnil."

#. TRANSLATORS: dialog heading
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:107 ui/internal/aiaccount/dialog.go:364
msgid "Trust This Certificate?"
msgstr "Důvěřovat tomuto certifikátu?"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is one server ("host:port") or two joined by
#. "%s and %s".
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:110 ui/internal/aiaccount/dialog.go:367
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Only trust a certificate you expect, for example the one of a mail bridge on "
"your own computer. Malachi Mail will then accept exactly this certificate "
"for %s and no other, even if it is self-signed, issued for another name or "
"expired."
msgstr ""
"Důvěřujte jen certifikátu, který očekáváte, například certifikátu mostu "
"pošty na vlastním počítači. Malachi Mail pak pro %s přijme přesně tento "
"certifikát a žádný jiný, i když je podepsaný sám sebou, vystavený pro jiné "
"jméno nebo prošlý."

#. TRANSLATORS: destructive confirm button of "Trust This Certificate?"
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:113 ui/internal/aiaccount/dialog.go:370
msgid "_Trust"
msgstr "_Důvěřovat"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:167 ui/internal/signature/text.go:242
msgctxt "certificate"
msgid "SHA-256 fingerprint"
msgstr "Otisk SHA-256"

#. TRANSLATORS: label of the fingerprint of the certificate that was
#. pinned before
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:170
msgctxt "certificate"
msgid "Previously trusted"
msgstr "Dříve důvěřovaný"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:171 ui/internal/signature/text.go:268
msgctxt "certificate"
msgid "Issued to"
msgstr "Vystaveno pro"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:172 ui/internal/signature/text.go:270
msgctxt "certificate"
msgid "Issued by"
msgstr "Vydal"

#. TRANSLATORS: validity period of a certificate: two dates
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:176 ui/internal/signature/text.go:282
#, c-format
msgctxt "certificate"
msgid "%s to %s"
msgstr "%s až %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: label of a certificate's validity period
#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:178 ui/internal/signature/text.go:272
msgctxt "certificate"
msgid "Valid"
msgstr "Platnost"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/trust.go:181
msgctxt "certificate"
msgid "Self-signed"
msgstr "Podepsaný sám sebou"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/wizard.go:251 ui/internal/crm/text.go:431
msgid "New Password (leave empty to keep)"
msgstr "Nové heslo (prázdné = ponechat)"

#: ui/internal/accountwizard/wizard.go:253
