msgstr "_Test"

#. TRANSLATORS: status of the AI provider dialog after a test that listed no models.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:90
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Připojeno"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:95
msgid "Enter a name for the account"
msgstr "Zadejte název účtu"

#. TRANSLATORS: the address example stays as it is.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:97
msgid "Enter the server's address, such as http://localhost:11434/v1"
msgstr "Zadejte adresu serveru, třeba http://localhost:11434/v1"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:98 ui/internal/jira/wizard.go:161
#: ui/internal/jira/wizard.go:414 ui/internal/crm/text.go:457
#: ui/internal/crm/text.go:564
msgid "This is not a web address"
msgstr "Toto není webová adresa"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:99
msgid "A certificate can be pinned only for an https address"
msgstr "Certifikát lze připnout jen u adresy https"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:100
msgid "Enter the API key"
msgstr "Zadejte klíč API"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:101
msgid "Enter or choose a model"
msgstr "Zadejte nebo vyberte model"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:102
msgid "This is not a model id"
msgstr "Toto není id modelu"

#. TRANSLATORS: Save of the AI provider dialog with the consent check box off.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:104
msgid "Allow sending mail to the provider first"
msgstr "Nejdřív dovolte posílání pošty poskytovateli"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:106
msgid "The provider could not be reached"
msgstr "Poskytovatel není dostupný"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:107
msgid "The provider did not answer in time"
msgstr "Poskytovatel neodpověděl včas"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:108
msgid "The connection to the provider is not secure"
msgstr "Spojení s poskytovatelem není zabezpečené"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:109
msgid "The provider answered with an error"
msgstr "Poskytovatel odpověděl chybou"

#. TRANSLATORS: status of the AI provider dialog after a test; %d is the number of models the provider listed.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:120
#, c-format
msgid "Connected · %d model"
msgid_plural "Connected · %d models"
msgstr[0] "Připojeno · %d model"
msgstr[1] "Připojeno · %d modely"
msgstr[2] "Připojeno · %d modelů"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the host of an OpenAI-compatible server reached over plain http.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:127
#, c-format
msgid "The API key and your mail travel unencrypted over http to %s."
msgstr "Klíč API a vaše pošta putují nešifrovaně přes http na %s."

#. TRANSLATORS: under the address field of an OpenAI-compatible server; the examples follow, one per line.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:154
msgid "The server's base URL, usually ending in /v1. For example:"
msgstr "Základní URL serveru, obvykle končí na /v1. Například:"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:181
msgid ""
"The assistant sends the prompt, the text you write, the mail it reads for "
"you and that mail's attachments to the provider. It can read mail and "
"prepare drafts; it cannot send, delete or move messages."
msgstr "Asistent posílá poskytovateli zadání, text, který píšete, poštu, kterou pro vás čte, a její přílohy. Umí číst poštu a připravovat koncepty; neumí zprávy posílat, mazat ani přesouvat."

#. TRANSLATORS: check box of the AI provider dialog; Save needs it on.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:183
msgid "Allow Malachi Mail to send mail to this provider"
msgstr "Dovolit Malachi Mail posílat poštu tomuto poskytovateli"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:187
msgid "Send Mail to Anthropic?"
msgstr "Poslat poštu do Anthropicu?"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:188
msgid ""
"They go to Anthropic under its API terms, which do not use data sent through "
"the API for training by default."
msgstr "Putují do Anthropicu podle jeho podmínek API, které data poslaná přes API ve výchozím nastavení nepoužívají k trénování."

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:190 ui/internal/assistant/chatgpt.go:58
msgid "Send Mail to OpenAI?"
msgstr "Poslat poštu do OpenAI?"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:191
msgid ""
"They go to OpenAI under its API terms, which do not use data sent through "
"the API for training by default."
msgstr "Putují do OpenAI podle jeho podmínek API, které data poslaná přes API ve výchozím nastavení nepoužívají k trénování."

#. TRANSLATORS: consent heading of an OpenAI-compatible server the user set the address of.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:194
msgid "Send Mail to Your Server?"
msgstr "Poslat poštu na váš server?"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:195
msgid ""
"They go to the server at the address you set. Over http they travel "
"unencrypted."
msgstr "Putují na server na adrese, kterou jste zadali. Přes http putují nešifrovaně."

#. TRANSLATORS: the kind of an AI provider account: the Anthropic Messages API with the user's own key.
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:188
msgid "Anthropic API"
msgstr "Anthropic API"

#. TRANSLATORS: the kind of an AI provider account: the OpenAI API with the user's own key.
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:190
msgid "OpenAI API"
msgstr "OpenAI API"

#. TRANSLATORS: the kind of an AI provider account: any server with the OpenAI chat completions interface (Ollama, llama.cpp, LM Studio, vLLM, a gateway).
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:192
msgid "OpenAI-compatible server"
msgstr "Server kompatibilní s OpenAI"

#. TRANSLATORS: row of Settings → AI: which provider the assistant in the app runs on (Claude Code, ChatGPT, or an AI provider account).
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:196
msgid "Assistant Uses"
msgstr "Asistent používá"

#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:197
msgid ""
"Claude Code or ChatGPT on this computer, or an AI provider added in "
