msgstr "Někdo napsal do úkolu, který je přiřazený vám."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:585
msgid "Someone wrote in an issue you reported."
msgstr "Někdo napsal do úkolu, který jste zadali."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:587
msgid "Someone wrote in an issue you commented on."
msgstr "Někdo napsal do úkolu, který jste komentovali."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:589
msgid "You only watch this issue."
msgstr "Tento úkol jen sledujete."

#: ui/internal/board/text.go:591
msgid ""
"The rules would no longer list it; your choice, a reminder, a deadline or a "
